WEBVTT

00:41.458 --> 00:43.961
NO TAIL TO TELL

01:18.161 --> 01:19.580
Get off me.

01:19.663 --> 01:21.498
Sorry.

01:28.922 --> 01:29.923
Are you…

01:30.757 --> 01:31.717
okay?

01:32.342 --> 01:34.344
Do I look okay to you right now?

01:34.428 --> 01:36.638
- Of course I'm not okay.
- I see.

01:39.308 --> 01:41.310
By the way…

01:44.146 --> 01:48.108
you just saw
that strange thing too, right?

01:51.737 --> 01:54.448
It's not strange. It's mystical.

01:55.407 --> 01:59.077
Anyway, it looks like I have
more urgent matters to attend to.

01:59.661 --> 02:00.704
What?

02:01.622 --> 02:03.290
I'll deal with you later.

02:07.544 --> 02:09.254
What are you doing?

02:10.631 --> 02:11.923
Damn it.

02:12.633 --> 02:14.509
Just how much spiritual power did I lose?

02:14.593 --> 02:16.803
I can't even do this all of a sudden?

02:19.514 --> 02:20.390
Darn it.

02:23.226 --> 02:26.188
What's with her? Is she an actual lunatic?

02:29.608 --> 02:31.485
But why did you come to see me…

02:31.568 --> 02:35.113
WARD 22
NURSING STATION

02:37.199 --> 02:38.533
Where did she go?

02:43.497 --> 02:46.208
STORAGE ROOM

02:52.422 --> 02:53.799
Are you kidding me?

03:31.628 --> 03:33.130
We need to talk.

03:47.519 --> 03:48.854
I said, we need to talk.

04:13.879 --> 04:15.338
I told you.

04:15.964 --> 04:18.592
I'm not that naive fox I used to be.

04:24.556 --> 04:26.516
All this wood will burn nicely.

04:33.482 --> 04:36.276
You're still wicked and irreverent.

04:38.195 --> 04:39.905
What do you think you're doing?

04:40.530 --> 04:43.366
I don't expect you to honor the deities,

04:43.450 --> 04:45.243
but you should at least be reasonable.

04:45.327 --> 04:48.163
I just lost a huge chunk
of my spiritual power.

04:48.246 --> 04:49.289
Out of the blue.

04:49.372 --> 04:52.042
But no matter how much
I think about it, I just don't get it.

04:59.716 --> 05:01.927
You've made quite a mess.

05:11.561 --> 05:15.273
Was it this iron rod
that smashed the statues,

05:15.357 --> 05:17.150
or was it you?

05:17.859 --> 05:19.194
What are you talking about?

05:19.277 --> 05:22.697
I didn't come all this way
to listen to your cryptic nonsense.

05:22.781 --> 05:24.616
Just tell me why!

05:28.745 --> 05:30.956
I've already given you the answer.

05:31.706 --> 05:35.335
You're just being stubborn
instead of seeking the truth yourself.

05:35.418 --> 05:38.797
I'm done cultivating myself,
so go ahead and do it as much as you want.

05:39.422 --> 05:41.925
- Tell me why!
- You've sinned,

05:42.008 --> 05:44.845
so you've paid the price.

05:45.762 --> 05:47.305
Don't be ridiculous.

05:47.931 --> 05:49.933
How is this an appropriate price?

05:50.517 --> 05:53.228
I said I lost a huge chunk
of my spiritual power.

05:53.311 --> 05:55.480
What did I do that was so wrong?

05:58.191 --> 05:59.526
A human has died.

06:00.610 --> 06:01.528
Because of you.

06:05.156 --> 06:06.408
What?

06:07.200 --> 06:08.451
What are you talking about?

06:08.535 --> 06:11.788
Because you twisted human fate recklessly,

06:12.414 --> 06:15.959
someone who wasn't
supposed to die has died.

06:37.564 --> 06:40.442
EPISODE 2
THE HOUR OF TRANSFER

06:40.525 --> 06:41.401
TRANSFER

06:41.484 --> 06:42.944
1. A BIZARRE EVENT THAT DEFIES REASON

06:43.028 --> 06:45.572
2. AN ATHLETE MOVING
FROM ONE TEAM TO ANOTHER

06:46.948 --> 06:51.077
URI GARAM HOSPITAL

06:52.621 --> 06:56.291
The next bus to arrive is number 360.

06:58.710 --> 06:59.753
Hi.

07:04.090 --> 07:05.175
You…

07:05.258 --> 07:08.219
You know,
I think you'll need to make a wish.

07:09.387 --> 07:10.639
What?

07:17.103 --> 07:19.856
Hey, wait. Please stop!

07:20.398 --> 07:23.109
Oh no! That was the last bus.

07:24.486 --> 07:26.821
- Did you even hear what I said?
- Just a second.

07:27.948 --> 07:31.826
Man, that really was the last bus.
I don't even have money for a cab.

07:31.910 --> 07:34.537
- Hey.
- Seriously, hold on a second.

07:35.789 --> 07:37.248
HOME
FASTEST ROUTE: 4H 24M

07:37.332 --> 07:39.626
It takes over four hours
to walk home, jeez.

07:40.251 --> 07:41.294
Hey.

07:45.131 --> 07:46.466
Where do you live?

07:46.549 --> 07:49.052
If I take you home,
will you actually listen to me?

07:50.011 --> 07:50.887
What?

07:52.305 --> 07:55.308
Have you heard of earth-folding?
It's similar to teleporting.

07:56.434 --> 07:59.354
Like in martial arts novels?

07:59.437 --> 08:00.480
Yeah, that.

08:00.563 --> 08:02.941
I'm telling you now
so you don't freak out.

08:06.444 --> 08:07.946
Let's go.

08:56.036 --> 08:57.704
What the heck was that?

08:58.455 --> 08:59.831
We're in front of my house.

08:59.914 --> 09:01.666
I told you it was earth-folding.

09:01.750 --> 09:03.209
I used sorcery to fold the earth.

09:03.918 --> 09:06.087
Fold… the earth?

09:07.297 --> 09:10.300
Wait, could you even travel
to Europe like this?

09:10.383 --> 09:13.428
Like to Germany and Spain?

09:14.679 --> 09:17.557
I guess not,
since they're across the ocean.

09:18.224 --> 09:19.309
Of course I can!

09:19.893 --> 09:21.227
That's not even an issue.

09:22.187 --> 09:25.273
Back in the day,
I'd wake up and go to New York for bagels,

09:25.356 --> 09:27.317
then go to France for lunch.

09:27.400 --> 09:29.277
I was a regular
at a restaurant over there.

09:29.360 --> 09:31.988
And after that,
I'd have my coffee in Italy.

09:32.906 --> 09:36.701
But after a year or two,
you get sick of it.

09:37.327 --> 09:38.661
That's insane.

09:41.956 --> 09:43.416
You know…

09:44.000 --> 09:45.460
that thing you just did.

09:46.294 --> 09:47.754
Could you do it one more time?

09:48.755 --> 09:52.967
Do I just need to hold
your hand like this?

10:08.274 --> 10:10.193
What… are you doing?

10:10.944 --> 10:12.403
Oh, I…

10:12.487 --> 10:15.907
I'm sorry, I just found it fascinating.

10:17.784 --> 10:18.701
Well…

10:19.911 --> 10:21.204
I only showed you this

10:21.287 --> 10:25.125
to make up
for embarrassing myself earlier.

10:25.208 --> 10:26.084
Okay.

10:29.462 --> 10:31.131
Anyway, that's not the point.

10:33.424 --> 10:36.177
You're going to help me.

10:37.762 --> 10:40.223
It's nothing big. Just make a simple wish.

10:41.516 --> 10:42.559
A wish?

10:42.642 --> 10:46.980
Yeah. I can't just interfere
in human affairs without a human's wish.

10:47.063 --> 10:48.940
So you have to make a wish for me.

10:53.027 --> 10:57.073
You want to catch that hit-and-run driver
and make him pay, right?

10:59.200 --> 11:00.201
Hey!

11:00.285 --> 11:02.287
Stop!

11:02.996 --> 11:04.330
I said stop!

11:07.208 --> 11:08.877
Wish for it.

11:09.711 --> 11:11.129
I'll grant it for you.

11:28.229 --> 11:29.856
No smoking in here.

11:33.902 --> 11:36.237
We could've done
this witness interview over the phone.

11:36.321 --> 11:38.489
Why drag someone so busy
all the way here?

11:39.115 --> 11:41.492
Oh, this isn't a witness interview.

11:41.576 --> 11:44.787
Mr. Lee has just been named a suspect.

11:45.580 --> 11:46.456
Wait,

11:46.539 --> 11:49.167
the real culprit for that hit-and-run
has already turned himself in--

11:49.250 --> 11:51.085
Well, the security footage…

11:53.338 --> 11:55.131
suddenly got restored last night.

11:56.049 --> 11:58.218
Strangely, all the cameras
in that area malfunctioned,

11:58.301 --> 12:00.136
so we hadn't been able
to confirm anything.

12:01.137 --> 12:02.222
Isn't that fortunate?

12:09.687 --> 12:10.772
Damn.

12:11.773 --> 12:12.732
Damn it.

12:16.277 --> 12:17.570
Okay.

12:28.748 --> 12:29.958
What the…

12:32.460 --> 12:34.712
Why aren't you showing up? Are you hiding?

12:52.355 --> 12:53.856
Damn it.

12:55.900 --> 12:57.193
What's she doing?

12:57.735 --> 13:00.863
After messing up a job like this,

13:01.406 --> 13:02.657
why aren't you showing up?

13:02.740 --> 13:03.658
Why?

13:04.951 --> 13:06.577
Disgusting. Shit.

13:06.661 --> 13:10.039
…SERVING THE PEOPLE, GOWON POLICE

13:11.499 --> 13:12.500
He's here! He's out!

13:12.583 --> 13:15.712
Is it true that you caused a hit-and-run
and had someone else take the fall?

13:15.795 --> 13:17.714
Any thoughts on the added DUI allegations?

13:17.797 --> 13:21.009
Do you think this will affect
your inheritance of the Geumsu Group?

13:21.092 --> 13:22.510
Just a word, please!

13:22.593 --> 13:24.679
Just a quick word on how you're feeling?

13:26.764 --> 13:29.309
- Please give us a statement!
- Just one statement!

13:31.769 --> 13:33.604
It's really nothing, Father.

13:34.272 --> 13:35.982
I'm telling you, I can handle this.

13:36.816 --> 13:38.443
Father… Father!

13:40.945 --> 13:44.198
Damn it, that senile old geezer.

13:45.158 --> 13:46.659
Shit.

13:50.038 --> 13:51.998
Did you take care of things last night?

13:52.540 --> 13:55.001
I took care of it
so it wouldn't cause any issues.

13:55.793 --> 13:57.378
There's no way

13:58.338 --> 14:00.631
- that they'll suddenly find Bong-chang.
- Good.

14:01.549 --> 14:04.385
If that blows up too,
I won't be able to handle it.

14:05.094 --> 14:05.970
Yes, sir.

14:08.348 --> 14:10.224
Of all the damn luck…

14:18.232 --> 14:19.150
What's happening?

14:19.859 --> 14:21.361
What's… wrong with this thing?

14:23.946 --> 14:25.448
In other news,

14:25.531 --> 14:29.911
a body was found earlier today
in the mountains near Gyeonggi Province.

14:29.994 --> 14:32.747
The victim has been identified as Mr. Ko,

14:32.830 --> 14:34.832
- a chauffeur for a construction company.
- Hey!

14:34.916 --> 14:36.876
- Police are investigating…
- Is that…

14:36.959 --> 14:39.587
- …treating it as a homicide.
- That's impossible.

14:39.670 --> 14:41.798
Hey! What are you doing?

14:43.257 --> 14:45.843
- I didn't do this. I swear!
- What the hell are you saying?

14:45.927 --> 14:47.053
It was me.

14:47.637 --> 14:48.554
You.

14:49.138 --> 14:51.015
You kept summoning me earlier.

14:51.641 --> 14:53.101
Too bad for you.

14:53.184 --> 14:55.228
You can't be my client anymore.

14:56.187 --> 14:58.523
Don't tell me you did all this?

15:02.777 --> 15:03.986
Hey…

15:04.070 --> 15:07.240
Pull over, you bastard.

15:08.074 --> 15:09.867
I told you I'd pay you.

15:10.410 --> 15:14.247
- So why are you doing this to me?
- I don't want to be doing this either.

15:14.330 --> 15:15.248
But…

15:16.582 --> 15:18.960
have you ever heard
of the butterfly effect?

15:19.627 --> 15:21.129
Everyone on the left side…

15:21.212 --> 15:22.547
I helped you.

15:22.630 --> 15:26.926
And that night, you got carried away
and drove home completely wasted.

15:27.009 --> 15:28.928
Then you caused an accident.

15:29.011 --> 15:31.472
And while trying to cover it up…

15:33.349 --> 15:36.477
- How dare you…
- …you ended up killing someone.

15:38.521 --> 15:40.148
I don't really get it either,

15:40.231 --> 15:42.900
but this is
what the ones above are saying.

15:42.984 --> 15:43.943
I helped you.

15:44.026 --> 15:47.029
And because of that, someone who wasn't
supposed to die is dead.

15:47.113 --> 15:48.114
What?

15:48.197 --> 15:51.659
Don't bother trying to understand.
I don't get it either.

15:52.326 --> 15:55.163
Anyway, one has to clean up
their own messes, right?

15:55.246 --> 15:57.874
Since I started this,
I'm going to sort it out myself.

15:57.957 --> 16:00.793
And that'll help me recover
some of my lost spiritual power.

16:00.877 --> 16:02.420
That was just a mistake.

16:03.045 --> 16:05.423
No, it was an accident.

16:05.506 --> 16:07.675
From now on, you won't be able to lie.

16:13.556 --> 16:16.976
And you won't be able
to hide anything anymore.

16:17.602 --> 16:19.520
Every single wrong you've ever committed,

16:20.563 --> 16:23.858
even that pen you stole
from the stationery store as a kid,

16:24.525 --> 16:26.235
you're going to confess to it all.

16:27.737 --> 16:28.863
Oh, right.

16:31.574 --> 16:32.825
I'll be taking this

16:33.576 --> 16:35.286
since you're no longer my client.

16:59.769 --> 17:01.354
Is he trying to say something?

17:03.064 --> 17:04.815
I want to turn myself in.

17:06.234 --> 17:07.401
What? Turn himself in?

17:07.485 --> 17:10.154
Are you confessing
to the hit-and-run incident?

17:10.238 --> 17:12.615
It's alleged
that you attempted to switch drivers.

17:12.698 --> 17:15.368
Is there a reason
why you decided to turn yourself in?

17:15.993 --> 17:17.036
I…

17:21.374 --> 17:22.708
killed

17:23.334 --> 17:24.627
someone!

17:24.710 --> 17:26.796
- Oh my God!
- What?

17:30.049 --> 17:31.008
I can't do this.

17:33.553 --> 17:34.679
You bastard.

17:40.393 --> 17:43.020
The victim died on the spot.

17:43.563 --> 17:45.898
And to cover up the crime,

17:46.857 --> 17:49.777
I ordered the body
to be buried in the mountains.

17:49.860 --> 17:50.861
- Come quickly.
- Yes, sir!

17:51.571 --> 17:53.155
All this time,

17:53.239 --> 17:54.782
I've been building slush funds

17:54.865 --> 17:57.368
- worth tens of billions of won…
- Hey, wait a minute!

17:57.451 --> 18:00.580
…through offshore tax evasion
using overseas subsidiaries!

18:00.663 --> 18:03.040
- Just a second!
- Was it intentional?

18:03.124 --> 18:05.543
FAIRNESS UNDER THE LAW
SERVING THE PEOPLE, GOWON POLICE

18:55.301 --> 18:56.260
This is a gift.

19:01.932 --> 19:03.351
What is this?

19:04.560 --> 19:07.104
It's a suitcase.
You'll probably need it soon.

19:07.813 --> 19:10.232
I'm sure you saw the news.
It all worked out thanks to you.

19:10.316 --> 19:12.902
I've even recovered
some of my spiritual power.

19:12.985 --> 19:14.111
Gosh…

19:14.195 --> 19:16.906
Was that really all you?

19:18.240 --> 19:19.158
Wow.

19:20.326 --> 19:21.952
You know, I've been wondering.

19:22.870 --> 19:25.998
Who exactly… are you?

19:27.833 --> 19:29.126
You want to know my name?

19:30.920 --> 19:32.004
Well, that's too bad.

19:32.088 --> 19:34.715
I don't usually tell humans my name.

19:34.799 --> 19:36.342
No. That's not what I meant.

19:36.425 --> 19:39.887
I mean, what are you exactly?
Not your name, but what you are.

19:40.971 --> 19:41.847
Oh, that.

19:44.392 --> 19:45.267
Take a guess.

19:45.935 --> 19:47.770
Well, I'm not sure.

19:49.647 --> 19:50.940
A demon?

19:51.023 --> 19:52.149
What?

19:52.233 --> 19:53.359
- Satan?
- What?

19:54.819 --> 19:55.861
No?

19:57.363 --> 19:59.657
Try again. Think of something more Korean.

20:05.496 --> 20:06.372
Well…

20:12.670 --> 20:14.922
- A maiden ghost?
- A nine-tailed fox!

20:15.005 --> 20:17.341
Can't you tell just by looking at me?
This beauty.

20:18.676 --> 20:20.094
And this mystique.

20:21.595 --> 20:23.180
A nine-tailed fox?

20:23.264 --> 20:25.349
Like an actual fox with nine tails…

20:26.016 --> 20:27.309
Wait!

20:28.060 --> 20:30.938
So I wasn't just seeing things back then.

20:32.022 --> 20:35.359
Yes, just like in Return of the Legend,
except I have no interest in livers.

20:35.443 --> 20:38.446
And I definitely have no interest
in becoming human.

20:39.071 --> 20:40.114
Wow.

20:40.197 --> 20:42.324
Anyway, that's not why I'm here this time.

20:44.118 --> 20:46.704
Take this. You'll need it sooner or later.

20:49.498 --> 20:50.458
What now…

20:50.541 --> 20:51.500
I WILL GRANT YOUR WISH

20:51.584 --> 20:53.335
Nine-tailed foxes do
this sort of thing too?

20:53.419 --> 20:54.879
Times have changed.

20:54.962 --> 20:57.298
Think of it as a business model.

20:57.381 --> 20:59.633
You're going to be quite wealthy soon.

20:59.717 --> 21:01.844
Wealthy enough to be my client.

21:03.095 --> 21:04.555
Seriously…

21:05.055 --> 21:07.057
Are you messing with me right now?

21:07.683 --> 21:08.559
What?

21:08.642 --> 21:09.852
I mean,

21:09.935 --> 21:13.397
last time, you called me a nobody
and told me not to dream big.

21:14.273 --> 21:16.484
You said all those mean things
about my future.

21:16.567 --> 21:17.610
What changed?

21:19.570 --> 21:21.238
Oh, that?

21:23.616 --> 21:26.118
I guess I misread things at first.

21:30.080 --> 21:32.958
Fate doesn't just change like that.

21:33.626 --> 21:35.419
Whatever, it's fine.

21:35.503 --> 21:37.755
I didn't care about what you said anyway.

21:38.422 --> 21:39.590
I told you.

21:39.673 --> 21:42.510
In a few years,
I'm going to be a really famous athlete.

21:44.512 --> 21:45.805
What I'm talking about

21:45.888 --> 21:48.224
is nothing like
your childish wishful thinking.

21:48.307 --> 21:50.976
I'm telling you
what I saw in your actual future.

21:53.187 --> 21:55.356
Whoa, it's hot! What was that?

21:55.439 --> 21:57.107
I had to show you how to use it.

21:57.191 --> 21:59.193
I'll appear whenever you burn that.

21:59.276 --> 22:02.488
Why couldn't you just say so
instead of scaring me like that?

22:03.906 --> 22:05.157
- Give it back.
- I already did.

22:05.241 --> 22:06.283
But it's gone.

22:06.909 --> 22:09.370
Well, I'll be away for a while
for personal reasons.

22:09.453 --> 22:10.955
And more importantly,

22:11.956 --> 22:15.292
it'd be annoying
if someone who's broke kept summoning me.

22:15.918 --> 22:18.087
So it'll appear naturally
when the time is right.

22:20.631 --> 22:22.591
You can go now. We're done.

22:26.136 --> 22:27.346
Seriously though…

22:28.097 --> 22:29.139
Are you really

22:30.057 --> 22:31.767
not going to tell me your name?

22:33.811 --> 22:35.062
What?

22:40.693 --> 22:41.902
Eun-ho.

22:43.529 --> 22:44.655
My name is Eun-ho.

22:50.286 --> 22:53.163
You should feel honored.
I don't tell just anyone.

22:55.040 --> 22:56.000
I see.

22:57.084 --> 22:58.711
Eun-ho.

23:08.596 --> 23:09.513
Kang Si-yeol?

23:14.184 --> 23:15.436
You must be tired.

23:16.353 --> 23:19.315
I'm Hong Yeon-su,
Team Leader at the Soccer Association.

23:19.398 --> 23:20.274
Remember me?

23:21.442 --> 23:23.068
Oh, right.

23:24.945 --> 23:26.906
It's nice to see you.

23:32.661 --> 23:34.455
Did you already hear the news?

23:35.289 --> 23:36.415
Pardon?

23:36.498 --> 23:40.628
You've been selected
for the youth national team.

23:42.254 --> 23:44.840
Me? On the national team?

23:44.924 --> 23:46.258
Do you have a passport?

23:46.342 --> 23:48.469
You have to leave next week
for overseas training.

23:48.552 --> 23:50.137
Wait a second.

23:50.763 --> 23:52.348
Why am I all of a sudden…

23:52.973 --> 23:55.559
I guess you haven't heard the news yet.

23:56.268 --> 23:59.605
You're a replacement for Hyeon Woo-seok.

23:59.688 --> 24:01.982
As you know, Hyeon Woo-seok is injured,

24:02.066 --> 24:04.818
so there's no clear starter
for that position right now.

24:06.612 --> 24:07.696
I see.

24:07.780 --> 24:09.365
Be prepared. I'll see you then.

24:09.448 --> 24:10.491
You realize

24:10.574 --> 24:14.578
this is a big opportunity for you, right?

24:42.272 --> 24:44.566
- Are you okay?
- Of course.

24:44.650 --> 24:48.821
My face is everything to me,
and I'm scar-free and still handsome.

24:50.280 --> 24:51.407
Whatever.

24:53.242 --> 24:55.369
How long will rehab take?

24:56.704 --> 24:59.415
I don't know. Maybe about a year.

25:02.418 --> 25:04.712
Hey, whatever you do, don't get injured.

25:04.795 --> 25:07.589
This rehab stuff is brutal.

25:09.842 --> 25:10.718
After rehab,

25:11.927 --> 25:14.054
you'll still be able to play, right?

25:14.680 --> 25:15.681
Of course.

25:17.558 --> 25:19.518
What else would I do besides soccer?

25:20.144 --> 25:24.940
Don't worry about me.
Just go and do your best, you punk.

25:25.566 --> 25:27.776
Finish your rehab
and get back as soon as you can.

25:27.860 --> 25:30.112
A year on your ass in rehab?
Total overkill.

25:30.195 --> 25:31.447
"My ass"?

25:31.530 --> 25:34.700
Fine. I'll be back in exactly six months.

25:36.326 --> 25:37.536
Until then,

25:38.245 --> 25:41.165
keep my spot warm
till I'm back, all right?

25:42.082 --> 25:43.834
Whatever, man.

25:44.334 --> 25:47.004
Hey, I came up with a new move.

25:49.548 --> 25:52.092
Since I'm right-footed,
it doesn't matter if my left gets injured.

25:52.176 --> 25:54.011
So, if I do it like this…

25:54.094 --> 25:55.512
Yeah, real good.

26:01.268 --> 26:02.728
Kang Si-yeol?

26:05.147 --> 26:06.231
Hello.

26:25.000 --> 26:28.337
NINE YEARS LATER

26:41.850 --> 26:43.268
What do you think?

26:46.563 --> 26:48.273
It's nice. I like it.

26:48.357 --> 26:49.525
Right?

26:50.776 --> 26:53.654
Islands like this
rarely come on the market.

26:53.737 --> 26:55.197
And it can also be developed.

26:55.948 --> 26:57.991
So, if you build a few villas over there

26:58.075 --> 26:59.993
and bring in tourists--

27:00.077 --> 27:03.080
No need.
I'll be the only one using this island.

27:03.163 --> 27:04.248
Pardon?

27:04.331 --> 27:07.709
I'm going to turn this whole island
into my private retreat.

27:08.377 --> 27:09.503
I see.

27:09.586 --> 27:12.256
But if you're the only one
using such a large island,

27:12.339 --> 27:14.591
how do you plan
on traveling back and forth?

27:14.675 --> 27:17.469
If a typhoon hits,
you'll be stranded all by yourself.

27:17.553 --> 27:20.222
I won't be traveling by boat,
so you don't need to worry.

27:20.305 --> 27:22.683
Anyway, how much was it again?

27:22.766 --> 27:25.102
Right. It's 12 billion won.

27:26.436 --> 27:28.689
It is a high-end property,

27:28.772 --> 27:32.359
but with a bit of negotiation,
we could maybe get it down to 11 billion.

27:33.360 --> 27:34.903
Forget it. It's just a billion won.

27:34.987 --> 27:37.739
What's the point of haggling
over pocket change?

27:39.825 --> 27:41.618
Go check. The money should be in.

27:42.703 --> 27:44.079
Okay, sure.

27:51.837 --> 27:52.838
Excuse me.

27:53.422 --> 27:55.924
Not a single won has come in.

27:57.634 --> 27:58.719
What?

27:59.511 --> 28:00.512
Hold on.

28:01.096 --> 28:03.599
Does that mean
I don't even have 12 billion won left?

28:03.682 --> 28:05.517
Just because I took a few years off?

28:06.393 --> 28:08.145
What would you like to do?

28:09.396 --> 28:12.191
Give me time. I know I can get the money.

28:15.527 --> 28:16.445
But…

28:17.863 --> 28:20.782
can't you make it
a clean 10 billion instead of 11?

32:11.930 --> 32:14.391
Premier League star Kang Si-yeol

32:14.474 --> 32:18.145
signed a massive contract extension
with Thames FC today.

32:18.228 --> 32:20.480
Thames FC announced through their website

32:20.564 --> 32:24.317
that they successfully
re-signed Kang Si-yeol.

32:24.401 --> 32:26.903
They expressed great joy and gratitude

32:26.987 --> 32:29.531
for being able to continue

32:29.614 --> 32:32.826
their journey with their team leader
and franchise star.

32:32.909 --> 32:35.495
Kang Si-yeol's new contract
will last for five years,

32:35.579 --> 32:38.623
making him one
of the highest-paid players in the league.

32:38.707 --> 32:41.001
Becoming the first Asian player

32:41.084 --> 32:43.920
to lead the league
in both goals and assists,

32:44.004 --> 32:46.548
Kang Si-yeol achieved
a career high last season.

32:46.631 --> 32:51.845
This sparked speculation
and media reports about his next transfer.

32:52.345 --> 32:53.972
Amid the growing interest,

32:54.055 --> 32:58.268
international media outlets rushed
to report on his contract renewal.

32:58.810 --> 33:02.522
Officials from several clubs
that had pursued Kang Si-yeol

33:02.606 --> 33:06.318
have expressed their disappointment
following the news.

33:06.401 --> 33:09.362
As Kang Si-yeol has emerged
as a global sports star

33:09.446 --> 33:10.739
beyond South Korea,

33:10.822 --> 33:16.495
soccer fans around the world
are eagerly awaiting his next move.

33:29.966 --> 33:35.514
NICHOLAS: HEART OF VICTORY

33:57.035 --> 34:00.038
Do you know what time it is?
Why are you still in bed?

34:05.710 --> 34:08.338
It's time you started living
like a normal person!

34:09.589 --> 34:11.216
Seriously, it's just soccer.

34:11.841 --> 34:14.469
Just because you quit
doesn't mean your life is over.

34:16.096 --> 34:19.015
Don't try to stop me.
I'm throwing all this out today.

34:27.649 --> 34:29.150
OUR ETERNAL LEGEND
COACH CHA BUM-KUN

34:29.234 --> 34:32.862
This is the Cha Bum-kun Soccer Award.
Why would you throw it away, you crazy…

34:38.910 --> 34:40.120
There's more inside.

34:52.173 --> 34:59.139
HYEON WOO-SEOK

35:09.482 --> 35:10.775
You don't…

35:11.735 --> 35:14.195
have to throw all of them away.

35:42.390 --> 35:43.433
I'm sorry.

35:47.771 --> 35:48.647
About what?

35:51.983 --> 35:53.610
For not succeeding like Si-yeol.

35:58.698 --> 36:01.242
You never know how life will turn out.

36:01.910 --> 36:04.829
You were better than Si-yeol
when you were younger.

36:08.583 --> 36:09.709
For now,

36:11.044 --> 36:12.295
he might be on top.

36:13.129 --> 36:15.924
But you never know
what could happen in 10 or 20 years.

36:17.592 --> 36:20.637
It all depends
on how you live from now on.

36:48.623 --> 36:49.791
Is it…

36:51.668 --> 36:52.711
raining outside?

37:41.092 --> 37:42.302
I guess

37:43.386 --> 37:45.096
we still need more time.

37:46.473 --> 37:48.683
You and I both.

37:54.856 --> 37:58.777
KANG SI-YEOL'S TOP PICK

38:00.361 --> 38:01.488
Welcome.

38:08.411 --> 38:10.205
KANG SI-YEOL'S CHOCOLATE BAR OF CHOICE

38:17.295 --> 38:20.256
He's basically raking in money.

38:23.176 --> 38:26.012
Oh my gosh!
I finally found the Kang Si-yeol bun.

38:26.095 --> 38:27.806
- Which sticker's inside? Check.
- Inside?

38:27.889 --> 38:29.057
I can't really see it.

38:29.140 --> 38:30.183
Hey.

38:30.683 --> 38:31.643
Yes?

38:32.519 --> 38:34.479
I grabbed it first.

38:34.562 --> 38:36.773
I had to hit five convenience stores
just to find it.

38:36.856 --> 38:38.274
No, that's not it.

38:38.358 --> 38:40.777
Do you guys know a lot about Kang Si-yeol?

38:42.695 --> 38:43.905
LIMITED EDITION BUN

38:50.036 --> 38:51.079
What is all this?

38:51.788 --> 38:53.915
It's all Si-yeol's merch. So cute, right?

38:55.542 --> 38:59.045
This is a fan club item
made to celebrate Si-yeol's Golden Boot.

38:59.128 --> 39:00.630
- And this--
- Enough of that!

39:01.548 --> 39:03.633
There's only one thing I'm curious about.

39:04.634 --> 39:06.094
Kang Si-yeol.

39:07.053 --> 39:08.596
How much does he really make?

39:08.680 --> 39:10.765
Didn't you see the recent articles?

39:11.391 --> 39:13.309
Apparently,
he makes 500 million won a week.

39:13.393 --> 39:15.812
And he's in tons of commercials.

39:15.895 --> 39:18.231
I heard he gets paid
over a billion won for each one.

39:18.314 --> 39:19.315
Really?

39:21.234 --> 39:25.738
Then that means he's finally
successful enough to be my client.

39:36.416 --> 39:38.001
What the heck is this?

39:42.714 --> 39:44.716
I AM KANG SI-YEOL
WRITTEN BY KANG SI-YEOL

39:44.799 --> 39:46.801
An autobiography?

39:53.433 --> 39:55.768
How many times
are you going to read that?

39:55.852 --> 39:56.811
What?

39:57.979 --> 39:59.439
It's a good book.

40:01.524 --> 40:03.484
I've never read a book

40:03.568 --> 40:05.987
that resonated with me
quite like this one.

40:07.780 --> 40:10.783
That's because
it's the only book you've ever read.

40:10.867 --> 40:12.535
I AM KANG SI-YEOL

40:14.370 --> 40:16.623
That's because everything is in here.

40:16.706 --> 40:18.291
The hardships of my youth.

40:18.374 --> 40:22.879
My constant effort, discipline,
and patience to overcome those hardships.

40:22.962 --> 40:25.214
Only to be met by inevitable despair.

40:26.591 --> 40:29.302
Despite the endless
resentment and jealousy,

40:29.385 --> 40:32.013
I rose above every limit to achieve

40:32.639 --> 40:33.765
dazzling success.

40:35.391 --> 40:37.352
All of that fits in a single book?

40:38.561 --> 40:41.648
Yeon-su, do you know
what the theme of this book really is?

40:41.731 --> 40:42.899
"I'm the best."

40:46.736 --> 40:49.906
"There may be arrogance,
but never complacency."

40:53.034 --> 40:55.536
I'm so proud that I am me.

40:56.663 --> 40:59.999
Yeah, and I'm also proud of myself

41:00.083 --> 41:02.835
for being your agent all this time.

41:03.711 --> 41:05.088
I really am handsome.

41:07.340 --> 41:08.841
Put it down already.

41:12.804 --> 41:14.806
KANG SI-YEOL IS KILLING IT ON THE FIELD!

41:14.889 --> 41:16.766
- Kang Si-yeol!
- Kang Si-yeol!

41:20.395 --> 41:22.105
HOLD YOUR BREATH
AND FALL FOR SI-YEOL

41:22.188 --> 41:23.773
- Wow, he's signing!
- Please sign mine too!

41:23.856 --> 41:25.274
KANG SI-YEOL IS SEXY…

41:31.322 --> 41:32.740
Thank you.

41:35.702 --> 41:37.286
Long time no see, Si-yeol.

41:44.502 --> 41:45.670
Excuse me…

41:47.213 --> 41:48.965
Where would you like me to sign?

41:51.259 --> 41:52.510
What?

41:52.593 --> 41:53.678
Oh, for crying out loud.

42:01.602 --> 42:02.895
Thank you.

42:24.083 --> 42:24.959
Wait…

42:26.294 --> 42:29.088
Did he seriously not recognize me?

42:49.609 --> 42:51.486
Excuse me, your suitcase is open!

43:05.625 --> 43:06.876
Excuse me, what are you doing--

43:06.959 --> 43:09.837
Since you went ahead
and signed my back without asking,

43:09.921 --> 43:11.255
I'm returning the favor.

43:23.976 --> 43:25.144
What's with that woman?

43:28.731 --> 43:30.608
INCHEON AIRPORT GOES WILD FOR KANG SI-YEOL

43:33.528 --> 43:35.655
DAEHEUNG CITIZENS FC OPEN TRYOUTS

43:35.780 --> 43:36.864
Keep running!

43:40.576 --> 43:42.495
Hey, Woo-seok.

43:44.080 --> 43:45.331
Hello, Coach.

43:45.414 --> 43:46.624
Yeah, hi.

43:47.708 --> 43:48.876
What are you doing here?

43:50.753 --> 43:51.629
Well…

43:56.759 --> 43:59.470
Wait, you're not here
for the tryouts, are you?

44:02.515 --> 44:05.226
WOW, DAEHEUNG CITIZENS SOCCER CLUB
LET'S MAKE HISTORY!

44:05.309 --> 44:07.395
- Here, Woo-seok.
- Thank you.

44:08.604 --> 44:09.856
You need to stir it.

44:15.695 --> 44:18.698
Woo-seok, why are you doing this?

44:18.781 --> 44:22.326
You were cut from this team
not too long ago.

44:22.410 --> 44:26.080
And you're back for an open tryout?
You really think that's going to work?

44:27.540 --> 44:29.876
Please just give me a fair chance, Coach.

44:30.710 --> 44:32.295
I've still got it.

44:32.378 --> 44:34.589
I took a few months off
and got my head straight--

44:34.672 --> 44:36.924
Do you think I don't know
how good you are?

44:37.008 --> 44:38.718
I coached you for years.

44:38.801 --> 44:42.096
This is the K4 League, kid.
It's the fourth division.

44:42.180 --> 44:44.473
Didn't you see how young those kids are?

44:44.557 --> 44:47.435
And you? How old are you now?

44:55.276 --> 45:00.156
Hey, the club says they won't
even offer you a paid contract

45:00.239 --> 45:02.575
because you'd be too expensive.

45:03.242 --> 45:06.829
More than anything,
playing here for a few more years

45:06.913 --> 45:08.664
won't change a thing for you.

45:09.373 --> 45:12.627
Shouldn't you look for something else
while you're still young?

45:15.087 --> 45:19.258
What, you think training here a bit more
is going to get you into the K League?

45:19.342 --> 45:20.676
Or even the national team?

45:24.305 --> 45:29.143
COACH'S OFFICE

45:41.489 --> 45:42.823
I'm in Korea right now.

45:42.907 --> 45:45.701
If you're free later,
do you want to meet at our usual spot?

45:45.785 --> 45:47.370
SI-YEOL

45:47.453 --> 45:49.121
What are you doing? Busy?

45:58.047 --> 45:59.340
Yeah.

46:01.217 --> 46:02.677
What am I doing?

46:20.778 --> 46:22.196
SI-YEOL

46:22.280 --> 46:24.907
Hey, I'm still waiting.

46:33.833 --> 46:36.294
Seriously, he should at least reply.

46:50.141 --> 46:54.937
DELIVERY KING

46:55.896 --> 46:56.856
As you requested,

46:56.939 --> 46:59.483
we've designed it based on
a private theme park concept.

47:00.234 --> 47:02.153
But if we do this,
the costs will skyrocket--

47:02.236 --> 47:04.739
Don't worry about the money.

47:04.822 --> 47:06.574
A huge sum is coming my way soon.

47:07.283 --> 47:08.659
Hold on. Stop there.

47:09.285 --> 47:11.620
Are those the only
dining chairs they have?

47:12.121 --> 47:16.584
I need a luxurious chair,
worthy of a high-end mansion…

47:18.502 --> 47:20.046
Maybe I should make one.

47:23.632 --> 47:26.886
You signed up
for the workshop today, right?

47:27.845 --> 47:30.556
Yeah, I did.
I've done a lot of things in my time.

47:31.307 --> 47:34.143
But I've never tried woodworking,
so I wanted to give it a go.

47:34.226 --> 47:36.062
Oh, I see.

47:36.562 --> 47:38.773
Since it's your first time,

47:38.856 --> 47:41.734
how about a cutting board or a trivet?

47:42.234 --> 47:43.569
A trivet? Please.

47:44.236 --> 47:45.571
I'm going to make a chair.

47:47.782 --> 47:49.950
Not a boring chair like that one.

47:50.534 --> 47:52.536
A chair that perfectly fits
the curves of my body

47:52.620 --> 47:56.957
and wraps me in comfort
while looking elegant and refined.

47:57.041 --> 47:58.834
A chair that's like a work of art.

47:59.877 --> 48:03.297
It's not as easy as it looks.

48:03.964 --> 48:05.716
It's not as easy as it looks.

48:05.800 --> 48:09.095
So, use holds of the same color,
and at the top--

48:09.178 --> 48:10.721
But that is too easy.

48:13.307 --> 48:15.101
I'm going to climb that one.

48:18.104 --> 48:19.397
- Wow.
- She's fearless.

48:21.774 --> 48:24.193
This is way too easy.

48:26.028 --> 48:27.571
What's so fun about this?

48:28.322 --> 48:31.117
Look at her go.
She doesn't seem scared at all.

48:36.163 --> 48:37.957
- What was that?
- She practically flew!

48:38.040 --> 48:40.000
- How is that possible?
- She flew!

48:46.549 --> 48:47.758
You're going to do what?

48:47.842 --> 48:49.844
I'm thinking of putting together
an idol group.

48:49.927 --> 48:51.804
K-pop is all the rage these days.

49:01.439 --> 49:05.067
Gosh, you created the group FOX9?

49:06.652 --> 49:10.156
It's not "FOX9." It's F.O.X.9!

49:10.823 --> 49:12.116
Don't be so out of touch.

49:13.492 --> 49:17.037
Anyway, hitting number one once
really went to their heads.

49:17.121 --> 49:18.456
So I quit that too.

49:22.501 --> 49:24.211
Anyway, I'm all set.

49:25.004 --> 49:26.547
So, what do I do now?

49:34.180 --> 49:36.765
Shall we try again from the beginning?

49:42.938 --> 49:44.023
I did it!

49:44.106 --> 49:48.110
My gosh, I think I have a talent
for woodworking too.

49:48.194 --> 49:49.778
Well, now that you've finished one leg,

49:49.862 --> 49:52.364
shall we try making the other three?

49:55.242 --> 49:56.952
You want me to do more sawing?

49:59.955 --> 50:00.831
Excuse me.

50:30.778 --> 50:32.571
The chair's almost finished,

50:32.655 --> 50:34.782
and he still hasn't summoned me?

50:35.574 --> 50:37.993
I even made sure
the business card appeared.

50:49.547 --> 50:50.422
START

51:07.982 --> 51:09.108
Man, it's freezing.

51:14.029 --> 51:16.740
My muscles are recovering.

51:18.576 --> 51:19.910
- What's that?
- Jeez!

51:19.994 --> 51:21.537
Gosh, that's cold!

51:23.998 --> 51:25.374
You again.

51:30.462 --> 51:31.505
Who are you?

51:32.548 --> 51:33.674
How did you get in here?

51:34.508 --> 51:37.845
Why don't you come out?
I'm here on business.

51:37.928 --> 51:40.222
No, I can't exactly come out right now…

51:41.974 --> 51:44.685
Wait, you can't just barge
into someone's house.

51:44.768 --> 51:46.395
Are you one of my fans?

51:46.478 --> 51:49.732
Even if you are, this is still a crime.

51:49.815 --> 51:51.442
Then report me.

51:52.067 --> 51:54.111
- What?
- I said, go ahead and report me.

52:01.994 --> 52:02.870
Look…

52:03.787 --> 52:05.080
I won't report you.

52:05.873 --> 52:07.791
So could you just toss me
that towel over there?

52:07.875 --> 52:09.209
I need it to get out.

52:09.835 --> 52:10.794
No.

52:10.878 --> 52:14.006
On second thought, this is fine.
So you can just listen from there.

52:14.089 --> 52:16.634
Come on. Just toss it to me!

52:16.717 --> 52:17.843
Hey, you.

52:18.594 --> 52:19.887
Do you really not remember me?

52:19.970 --> 52:22.848
How should I know who you are?

52:25.768 --> 52:26.769
Wait a minute.

52:27.811 --> 52:31.315
Actually, you do look a bit familiar.

52:36.528 --> 52:37.613
Hey!

52:40.908 --> 52:44.328
Do you remember me now?
Long time no see, Si-yeol.

52:49.625 --> 52:52.002
Congratulations. Today is the day.

52:52.086 --> 52:54.922
The day you've been waiting
and hoping for.

52:55.839 --> 52:56.840
Pardon?

52:58.550 --> 53:00.010
You've become quite wealthy.

53:00.094 --> 53:01.053
I WILL GRANT YOUR WISH

53:01.136 --> 53:03.889
Which means you're finally eligible
to be one of my clients.

53:03.972 --> 53:04.932
Tell me. Whatever it is.

53:05.015 --> 53:06.141
What's your wish?

53:08.102 --> 53:09.603
- Well--
- Wait.

53:09.687 --> 53:12.523
For the record, you should
choose your wish very carefully.

53:12.606 --> 53:15.109
Because my fee
is going to be extremely high.

53:21.699 --> 53:23.617
But I don't have one.

53:24.284 --> 53:26.745
- What?
- I don't have any wishes.

53:33.669 --> 53:36.880
I don't think
you quite understand the situation.

53:36.964 --> 53:38.674
This is an incredible opportunity.

53:38.757 --> 53:42.177
Any human would be dying
to ask me for a wish.

53:42.845 --> 53:46.140
I like my life the way it is.
There's nothing I want to change.

53:48.642 --> 53:50.811
Didn't you miss out
on that undefeated title or whatever?

53:50.894 --> 53:52.354
I can make that happen for you.

53:53.814 --> 53:58.068
What's the point of that?
What matters is doing it myself.

53:58.152 --> 54:01.780
Really? That's unexpected.
I didn't take you for that type.

54:01.864 --> 54:04.241
But I can do much more than just that.

54:04.324 --> 54:06.660
For example…

54:06.744 --> 54:10.038
I can change your body
to what it was when you were 20.

54:11.790 --> 54:15.377
Perhaps you didn't get
a good look at me earlier.

54:16.545 --> 54:20.424
I had a checkup recently,
and my biological age is 21.

54:21.550 --> 54:22.968
What about your parents?

54:23.051 --> 54:24.678
Are they suffering from any illnesses?

54:24.762 --> 54:28.474
Once humans reach that age,
something inevitably starts to break down.

54:28.557 --> 54:29.850
I can heal them for you.

54:30.976 --> 54:32.561
I was raised by my grandmother.

54:32.644 --> 54:35.147
My parents passed away when I was young.

54:35.230 --> 54:36.440
Your grandmother, then!

54:37.107 --> 54:38.859
Aren't you worried about her health?

54:38.942 --> 54:41.361
She passed away a few years ago.

54:44.156 --> 54:45.783
Well, that's quite… unfortunate.

54:48.994 --> 54:50.579
Anyway, think about it.

54:51.205 --> 54:53.290
You might not want anything right now,

54:54.166 --> 54:55.167
but life is long.

54:56.084 --> 54:57.711
You may not know it,

54:57.795 --> 55:00.130
but human life is very fragile.

55:00.798 --> 55:03.967
It can be shattered so easily
by even the smallest of things.

55:05.803 --> 55:06.887
When that happens…

55:08.138 --> 55:09.765
you'll be needing my help.

55:24.196 --> 55:25.280
She's still the same.

55:25.989 --> 55:28.408
She comes and goes as she pleases.

55:29.701 --> 55:31.411
Back when my life was whole,

55:31.495 --> 55:33.372
and everything was in its place…

55:36.375 --> 55:38.085
- Enjoy your meal.
- Thank you.

55:40.671 --> 55:41.672
Woo-seok.

55:45.133 --> 55:47.928
I didn't know then.

55:48.720 --> 55:52.891
Ms. Hong! We've got a problem.
You need to see this.

55:56.854 --> 55:59.523
I didn't know
just how fragile human life is

56:00.566 --> 56:02.442
and how easily it can shatter.

56:08.782 --> 56:11.952
I just got back today,
so I don't really have anything to offer.

56:12.661 --> 56:15.372
It's fine. I have to get going soon.

56:16.540 --> 56:19.209
Hey, man. What's going on with you?

56:22.504 --> 56:23.380
Well…

56:24.381 --> 56:25.340
I…

56:26.258 --> 56:27.217
I quit soccer.

56:27.968 --> 56:29.761
- What?
- Why are you so surprised?

56:29.845 --> 56:31.054
We aren't the same.

56:34.558 --> 56:37.603
It wouldn't have been a surprise
if I'd quit at any point.

56:38.270 --> 56:39.897
Wait, you quit?

56:40.606 --> 56:42.482
What, did you retire? When?

56:42.566 --> 56:43.775
No, it's just…

56:45.193 --> 56:46.194
It's been a few months.

56:47.529 --> 56:48.572
And…

56:49.489 --> 56:50.782
I didn't retire. I was cut.

56:51.575 --> 56:53.201
Hey, why didn't you tell me?

56:53.285 --> 56:54.745
It's embarrassing.

56:54.828 --> 56:56.955
How could I tell you something like that?

56:57.039 --> 56:58.665
And what would that have changed?

57:01.335 --> 57:02.377
We…

57:03.921 --> 57:05.339
live in different worlds now,

57:06.924 --> 57:08.800
and worry about different things.

57:10.177 --> 57:12.387
How could you say that?

57:12.471 --> 57:14.640
Is that all our friendship means to you?

57:18.310 --> 57:19.978
I WILL GRANT YOUR WISH

57:20.103 --> 57:21.438
Anyway,

57:22.189 --> 57:23.273
what's this?

57:23.774 --> 57:24.733
Oh, that.

57:26.693 --> 57:27.569
Hey, Woo-seok.

57:28.320 --> 57:29.529
By any chance,

57:31.198 --> 57:32.199
do you have a wish?

57:34.284 --> 57:37.245
I have regretted this moment

57:38.372 --> 57:39.456
for a very long time.

58:09.569 --> 58:10.570
What the…

58:15.450 --> 58:16.535
Here.

58:17.119 --> 58:19.621
You dropped this, Mr. Hyeon.

58:19.705 --> 58:20.831
Oh, I see.

58:23.166 --> 58:24.626
But how do you know my name?

58:25.293 --> 58:30.382
Of course I know you.
Everyone in Korea knows who you are.

58:30.465 --> 58:31.341
Right.

58:31.425 --> 58:32.551
Wait, what?

58:33.385 --> 58:34.553
What do you mean…

58:35.971 --> 58:36.888
Excuse me?

58:55.032 --> 58:55.991
What the…

59:03.915 --> 59:05.042
Where am I?

59:35.614 --> 59:36.740
FOREVER CARE NURSING HOME

59:36.865 --> 59:38.033
What is this?

59:39.951 --> 59:41.328
KANG SI-YEOL

59:43.747 --> 59:45.290
Did you sleep well, Si-yeol?

59:45.916 --> 59:47.751
What's going on right now?

59:47.834 --> 59:49.628
What happened?

59:50.170 --> 59:51.171
Why am I suddenly here?

59:51.922 --> 59:54.424
You made a wish, so a price must be paid.

59:54.508 --> 59:55.425
What?

59:56.259 --> 59:58.095
Wait, what does Woo-seok's wish
have to do--

59:58.178 --> 59:59.888
Didn't I tell you?

59:59.971 --> 01:00:02.599
I can grant the wish,
but how I do it is up to me.

01:00:03.725 --> 01:00:06.144
Once again, your wish has been granted.

01:00:50.105 --> 01:00:53.024
NO TAIL TO TELL

01:00:53.108 --> 01:00:55.402
Who are you people? What is this?

01:00:55.485 --> 01:00:58.446
Since someone became
a world-class soccer player,

01:00:58.530 --> 01:01:02.117
someone else must step down
to maintain the balance.

01:01:02.200 --> 01:01:04.703
- Are you kidding me? You…
- I have only one principle.

01:01:04.786 --> 01:01:07.747
I avoid doing even the smallest good deed
and only avoid doing major misdeeds.

01:01:07.831 --> 01:01:10.125
Just do it.
Unless it's beyond your capability.

01:01:10.208 --> 01:01:12.210
Fine. And of course, you'll pay the price.

01:01:12.294 --> 01:01:14.129
There's a story
behind this object, isn't there?

01:01:14.212 --> 01:01:18.300
Eun-ho, I have a wish.
Could you grant it for me?

01:01:19.050 --> 01:01:21.553
When you get out, let's do a job together.

01:01:21.636 --> 01:01:25.223
Starting now, I'm going on a fox hunt.

01:01:27.601 --> 01:01:29.603
Subtitle translation by Susanna Kim
